{{col-top|2|cog}}
Cognate with {{cog|frr|widj|t=wide}}, {{cog|stq|wied|t=wide}}, {{cog|fy|wiid|t=broad; wide}}, {{cog|gmw-cfr|weck}}, {{m|gmw-cfr|weit}}, {{m|gmw-cfr|wick}}, {{m|gmw-cfr|wiet|t=distant, far, wide}}, {{cog|nl|wijd|t=wide; large; broad}}, {{cog|de|weit|t=far; wide; broad}}, {{cog|lb|weit|t=wide}}, {{m|lb|wäit|t=far}}, {{cog|yi|ווײַט|t=distant, far}}, {{cog|da,nb,nn,sv|vid|t=wide}}, {{cog|fo,is|víður|t=wide}}; also {{cog|br|gwez|t=trees}}, {{cog|kw|gwedh}}, {{m|kw|gwëdh}}, {{m|kw|gwydh}}, {{m|kw|gwÿdh|t=trees}}, {{cog|ga,gd|fiodh|t=timber, wood}}, {{cog|gv|fuygh|t=timber, wood}}, {{cog|cy|gwŷdd|t=trees}}, {{cog|la|dīvidō|t=to divide, separate}}, {{cog|ltg|vyds|t=middle}}, {{cog|lv|vidus|t=center, middle}}, {{cog|lt|vidùs|t=interior, inside; inward}}, {{cog|xto,txb|wätk-|t=to distinguish, separate}}. Related to {{l|en|widow}}.
